Dialogue: 13,0:23:06.03,0:23:12.16,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}君へのレクイエム Sing along
Dialogue: 12,0:23:13.20,0:23:20.42,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}用赞美的旋律 歌颂难忘的记忆
Dialogue: 13,0:23:13.20,0:23:20.42,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}讃える歌声 忘れ得ぬメモリー
Dialogue: 12,0:23:20.42,0:23:25.38,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}And we’ll never forget your name
